<h1>Scheduling &amp; triggers</h1>
<p>A <a href="/concepts-pipelines">pipeline</a> runs either on a schedule or in response to incoming events. This guide covers both.</p>

<h2>Scheduled pipelines</h2>
<p>Set a <code>schedule</code> (a cron expression) when creating or updating a pipeline via the <a href="/apis/pipelines">Pipelines endpoint</a>. Godzilla runs the pipeline once per schedule tick, processing whatever new data is available from the source since the last run.</p>

