<h1>Monitoring &amp; alerts</h1>
<p>Keep an eye on a running <a href="/concepts-pipelines">pipeline</a> without babysitting it manually.</p>

<h2>Connector health</h2>
<p>Poll a connector's <code>health</code> field via the <a href="/apis/connectors">Connectors endpoint</a>, or better, subscribe to <code>connector.error</code> so you're notified the moment it degrades.</p>

<h2>Subscribing to pipeline lifecycle events</h2>
<p>The most reliable way to monitor a pipeline is a <a href="/apis/webhooks">webhook</a> subscription on <code>pipeline.failed</code> and <code>connector.error</code>.</p>

